### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = my-secret-api-key-123

### 1. GET / - Hello World (No Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. GET /receipts - Without API Key (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/receipts

### 3. GET /receipts - Get All Receipts
GET {{baseUrl}}/receipts
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 4. POST /receipts - Create a Receipt
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "issuedAt": "2026-03-19T10:00:00Z",
  "name": "Coffee",
  "price": 4.50
}


### 4b. POST /receipts - Create another Receipt
POST {{baseUrl}}/receipts
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "issuedAt": "2026-03-19T11:00:00Z",
  "name": "Croissant",
  "price": 3.00
}

### 4c. POST /receipts - Create another Receipt
POST {{baseUrl}}/receipts
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "issuedAt": "2026-03-19T12:30:00Z",
  "name": "Sandwich",
  "price": 7.50
}

### 4d. POST /receipts - Create another Receipt
POST {{baseUrl}}/receipts
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "issuedAt": "2026-03-20T09:00:00Z",
  "name": "Orange Juice",
  "price": 3.50
}

### 5. GET /receipts/:id - Get One Receipt (replace with actual UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/receipts/60857dee-a7a4-4037-b9ee-78cf6aca96a3
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 6. PATCH /receipts/:id - Update a Receipt (replace with actual UUID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/receipts/60857dee-a7a4-4037-b9ee-78cf6aca96a3
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "Espresso",
  "price": 5.00
}

### 7. DELETE /receipts/:id - Delete a Receipt (replace with actual UUID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/receipts/60857dee-a7a4-4037-b9ee-78cf6aca96a3
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 8. GET /receipts/:id - Not Found (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/receipts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 9. POST /receipts - Invalid Body (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/receipts
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -5
}
